'plan.seeds': 'How much of the only seed stock do you sow now: all of it, half with the rest sealed, or trial plots only to learn the soil?',
'plan.sprout': 'What do you do with the first crop that came up: eat all of it, or keep the best ears back as seed for the next sowing?',
'plan.year': 'Where does most of this year\'s labour go: the fields, the workshops and the ship, or exploring the country beyond the wire?',
'plan.sleepers': 'Do you bring another load of sleepers down from orbit, more hands but more mouths to feed, or leave them in the cold for now?',
'plan.prospect': 'How do you look for the ore the smelter needs: send a party, search from the lander, or send the lock-up with a promise?',
'plan.water': 'The water reclaimer is wearing out: do you ration water to spare it, or run it hard until it breaks?',
'plan.housed': 'Who gets the first houses: families with children, the hardest workers, or the officers and their crews?',
