'plan.ladle': 'The bins are filling again: do you bring back full rations for everyone, or only for the work crews?',
'aft.blame': 'The colony is asking who gave the order: do you say it was yours, have the watch stop the talk, or hold an inquiry that blames someone below you?',
'aft.press': 'What the colony fought is hurt and pulling back: do you follow it out now and finish it, or hold the wire?',
'aft.gift': 'Something has been left at the wire: do you take it in openly, or leave something of yours in return?',
'aft.find': 'One observation does not fit the notebook: do you test it tonight, tell the whole colony, or test it with someone posted where it matters?',
