'bld.find': 'What do you do about the buried plane and its spire: dig down to it, study it with instruments, or fence it off?',
'bld.wake': (s, c) => c && c.first ? `Do you send an expedition through the opening, blow it shut, or stay out and keep ${c.first} awake to draw?` : 'Do you send an expedition through the opening, blow it shut, or stay out and keep the one who touched it awake to draw?',
'bld.offer': 'Do you tap the spire\'s power, with your own crew or someone from the lock-up holding the cable, or leave all of it alone?',
