'oth.signal': 'Do you answer the old ship\'s beacon, or listen without transmitting?',
'oth.contact': 'Eleven from the Reach have come to talk: do you trade with them, take them in as guests, or rob them and send them home?',
'oth.demand': 'Sixty hungry people from the Reach are at the gate: do you feed them from your own weakest, take them all in on half rations, or hold the gate?',
'oth.kin': 'The Reach offers its reactor core for new blood: do you pay in sleepers or embryos, or refuse?',
'oth.raid': 'Raiders from the south robbed you in the night: do you chase them down, fortify and throw out the watch that slept, or cut off their medicine until they return it?',
'hive.tracks': 'Something left a knotted bundle on the fence: do you trap it, leave it food, or film it?',
'hive.drums': s => s.flags && s.flags.hive_trapped ? 'The snare has caught a young one: do you carry it back to them, keep it for study, or put up floodlights and a fence that means it?' : 'Do you answer the drumming, or put up floodlights and a fence that means it?',
'hive.border': 'Do you honour the drummers\' border, offer metal for passage across it, or cross it under guard for the ground on their side?',
'hive.raid': 'The drummers are wrecking the fields: do you destroy their warren, poison their trails, or pull back inside their line?',
